<title>UK: Wuestenrot Hypo sets 500 mln mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Hypo sets 500 mln mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Baden-Wuerttemburgische Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    09.SEP.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =/AAA     ISS PRICE  100.21    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    STUT	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 112</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
